hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1141","Muhammad bin al Tufail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak se, woh Jabir bin Samura se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: jab hum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aate to hum me se har shakhs wahan baith jata jahan majlis khatm hoti."
"1142","Ibrahim bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Furat bin Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Usama bin Zaid se, woh Amr bin Shuaib se, woh apne walid se, woh Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: kisi aadmi ke liye halal nahin ke woh do aadmiyon ke darmiyan judai dale magar un dono ki ijazat se."
"1143","Bayan bin Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nadr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir al Muzani jo Saleh bin Rustum hain ne humein khabar di, Ibn Abi Mulaika se, woh Ibn Abbas se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: jab Umar raziyallahu anhu ko zakhmi kiya gaya to main un logon me tha jinhon ne unhein uthaya hatta ke hum unhein ghar me le aaye, to unhon ne mujh se kaha: aye mere bhatije, jao dekho mujhe kis ne mara hai aur mere sath aur kin ko laga hai, pas main gaya phir unhein khabar dene ke liye aaya to ghar bhara hua tha, to maine un ki gardanein phalangna napasand kiya aur main kam umr tha, pas main baith gaya, aur woh jab kisi ko kisi hajat ke liye bhejte to use hukum dete ke use unhein bataye, aur us waqt woh kapde me lapete hue lete hue the, aur Kaab aaye to unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam agar Ameerul Momineen dua karein to Allah unhein zaroor baqi rakhega aur is ummat ke liye unhein zaroor buland karega hatta ke woh is me aisa aisa karein, hatta ke unhon ne munafiqon ka zikr kiya pas naam liya aur kinaya kiya, maine kaha: jo tum kehte ho kya main use un tak pahunchadun, unhon ne kaha: maine jo kaha hai sirf is irade se kaha hai ke tum use un tak pahunchao, pas maine himmat ki aur khada hua, pas un ki gardanein phalangta hua hatta ke un ke sar ke paas baith gaya, maine kaha: beshak aap ne mujhe is kaam ke liye bheja tha, aur aap ke sath itne logon ko laga hai, terah afrad ko, aur Kulayb Jazzaar ko laga hai jabke woh Mihras ke paas wuzu kar rahe the, aur beshak Kaab Allah ki qasam kha kar aisa keh rahe hain, to unhon ne kaha: Kaab ko bulao, pas woh bulaye gaye, to unhon ne kaha: tum kya kehte ho, unhon ne kaha: main aisa aisa kehta hun, unhon ne kaha: nahin Allah ki qasam main dua nahin karunga, lekin Umar badbakht hai agar Allah ne use na bakhsha."
"1144","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abda ne Ibn Abi Khalid se humein khabar di, woh Shabi se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: ek aadmi Abdullah bin Amr ke paas aaya jabke un ke paas log baithe hue the, woh un tak pahunchne ke liye gardanein phalangta hua aane laga, to logon ne use roka, to unhon ne kaha: is aadmi ko chhor do, pas woh aaya hatta ke un ke paas baith gaya, phir us ne kaha: mujhe koi aisi cheez bataiye jo aap ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suni ho, unhon ne kaha: maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Musalman woh hai jis ki zuban aur hath se Musalman mehfooz rahen, aur Muhajir woh hai jo us cheez ko chhor de jis se Allah ne mana kiya hai."
"1145","Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saib bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Isa bin Musa ne bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Abbad bin Jafar se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne kaha: logon me mere nazdeek sab se zyada izzat wala mera hamnashin hai."
"1146","Abu Nuaim ne Abdullah bin Muammal se, woh Ibn Abi Mulaika se, woh Ibn Abbas se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: logon me mere nazdeek sab se zyada izzat wala mera hamnashin hai ke woh logon ki gardanein phalang kar mere paas aakar baithe."
"1147","Muhammad bin Abdul Aziz ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asad bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya bin Saleh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Abu al Zahiriya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Kaseer bin Murra ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main Juma ke din masjid me dakhil hua to maine Auf bin Malik al Ashjai ko ek halqe me baitha paya apne dono paon apne samne phailaye hue, pas jab unhon ne mujhe dekha to apne paon samet liye, phir mujh se kaha: tum jante ho maine apne paon kis liye phailaye the, taake koi nek aadmi aaye aur baithe."
"1148","Abu Mamar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Utba bin Abdul Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Zurara bin Karim bin Haris bin Amr al Sahmi ne bayan kiya ke Haris bin Amr al Sahmi ne un se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya jabke woh Mina me the ya Arafat me, aur logon ne unhein gher rakha tha, aur dehati aate, pas jab woh un ka chehra dekhte to kehte: ye mubarak chehra hai, maine kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, mere liye maghfirat ki dua farmaiye, to unhon ne farmaya: Ay Allah humein bakhsh de, pas main ghoom kar aaya aur maine kaha: mere liye maghfirat ki dua farmaiye, unhon ne kaha: Ay Allah humein bakhsh de, pas main ghoom kar aaya aur maine kaha: mere liye maghfirat ki dua farmaiye, to unhon ne farmaya: Ay Allah humein bakhsh de, phir woh thookne lage, to unhon ne apne hath se ishara kiya pas us se apna thook liya aur us se apna joota ponchha, is liye ke woh napasand karte the ke un ke ird gird me se kisi ko lage."
"1149","Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Bilal ne Ala se, woh apne walid se, woh Abu Huraira se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne raaston par majlison se mana farmaya, to logon ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, humein apne gharon me baithna dushwar lagta hai, unhon ne kaha: pas agar tum baithe to majlison ka haq ada karo, unhon ne kaha: un ka haq kya hai Ya Rasoolallah, unhon ne kaha: saail ko rasta batana, salam ka jawab dena, nigahein neechi rakhna, neki ka hukum dena aur burai se mana karna."
"1150","Muhammad bin Ubaidullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Darawardi ne Zaid bin Aslam se, woh Ata bin Yasar se, woh Abu Saeed al Khudri raziyallahu anhu se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: raaston me baithne se bacho, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, humein apni majlison se koi chara nahin hum un me baatein karte hain, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jab tum inkar karte ho to raaste ka haq ada karo, unhon ne kaha: raaste ka haq kya hai Ya Rasoolallah, unhon ne kaha: nazar neechi rakhna, takleef rokna, neki ka hukum dena aur burai se mana karna."
"1151","Saeed bin Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Jafar ne Shareek bin Abdullah se, woh Saeed bin al Musayyab se, woh Abu Musa al Ashari se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek din Madina ke baghat me se ek bagh ki taraf apni hajat ke liye nikle aur main un ke peeche nikla, pas jab woh bagh me dakhil hue to main us ke darwaze par baith gaya aur maine kaha: aaj main zaroor Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka darban banunga halanke unhon ne mujhe hukum nahin diya tha, pas Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam gaye aur apni hajat poori ki aur kunwein ki mundair par baithe aur apni pindliyon se kapda uthaya aur unhein kunwein me latka diya, pas Abu Bakr raziyallahu anhu aaye taake un se andar aane ki ijazat mangein, to maine kaha: jahan ho wahin ruko hatta ke main tumhare liye ijazat mangun, pas woh ruk gaye aur main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya aur maine kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, Abu Bakr aap se andar aane ki ijazat mangte hain, to unhon ne farmaya: unhein ijazat de do aur unhein Jannat ki basharat de do, pas woh andar aaye aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke dayein taraf aaye, pas apni pindliyon se kapda uthaya aur unhein kunwein me latka diya, phir Umar aaye to maine kaha: jahan ho wahin ruko hatta ke main tumhare liye ijazat mangun, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: unhein ijazat de do aur unhein Jannat ki basharat de do, pas Umar Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke bayein taraf aaye aur apni pindliyon se kapda uthaya aur unhein kunwein me latka diya pas mundair bhar gayi aur us me baithne ki jagah na rahi, phir Usman aaye to maine kaha: jahan ho wahin ruko hatta ke main tumhare liye ijazat mangun, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: unhein ijazat de do aur unhein Jannat ki basharat de do us aazmaish ke sath jo unhein pahunchne wali hai, pas woh andar aaye aur un ke sath baithne ki jagah na payi, pas woh hate hatta ke un ke samne kunwein ke kinare par aaye, pas apni pindliyon se kapda uthaya phir unhein kunwein me latka diya, pas main tamanna karne laga ke mera koi bhai aaye aur main Allah se dua karne laga ke use le aaye, pas koi na aaya hatta ke woh khade ho gaye."
"1152","Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne Ubaidullah bin Abi Yazid se, woh Nafi bin Jubair bin Mutim se, woh Abu Huraira se riwayat karte hain, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam din ke ek hisse me nikle na mujh se baat karte the na main un se baat karta tha, hatta ke Bani Qainuqa ke bazaar aaye, pas Fatima ke ghar ke sehan me baithe, phir farmaya: kya wahan chhota bachcha hai, kya wahan chhota bachcha hai, pas unhon ne use kuch der rok liya, to maine gumaan kiya ke woh use haar pehna rahi hain ya use ghusl de rahi hain, pas woh daudta hua aaya hatta ke unhon ne use gale lagaya aur use bosa diya aur farmaya: Ay Allah is se muhabbat farma aur us se muhabbat farma jo is se muhabbat kare."
"1153","Qabeesa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah se, Nafi se, Hazrat Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mana farmaya ke aadmi kisi shakhs ko majlis se uthaye phir khud us jagah baith jaye."
"1154","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Hazrat Anas se ke unhon ne farmaya: Main ne ek din Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat ki, yahan tak ke jab main ne dekha ke main Un ki khidmat se farigh ho chuka hun to main ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam qailula farmayenge, to main Un ke paas se bahar nikla, to kya dekhta hun ke kuch larke khel rahe hain, to main un ka khel dekhne ke liye khara ho gaya, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashreef laye yahan tak ke un ke paas pahunche to un ko salam kiya, phir mujhe bulaya aur mujhe ek zaroorat ke liye bheja, to main saye mein raha yahan tak ke main Un ke paas aaya, aur main apni walida ke paas der se pahuncha, to unhon ne kaha: Kis cheez ne tujhe rok liya, main ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujhe ek zaroorat ke liye bheja tha, unhon ne kaha: Woh kya hai, main ne kaha: Woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka raaz hai, to unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke raaz ki hifazat kar, phir main ne us zaroorat ke bare mein makhlooq mein se kisi ko kabhi nahi bataya, pas agar main kabhi kisi ko batane wala hota to tujhe zaroor batata."
"1155","Ishaq bin al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin al-Haris ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Salim ne mujh se bayan kiya, Zubaidi se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Muhammad bin Muslim ne khabar di, Saeed bin al-Musayyab se ke unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira ko suna ke woh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka hulya bayan kar rahe the ke Aap darmiyana qad wale the, aur Aap darazi ki taraf zyada mayil the, sakht safed rang wale the, darhi ke baal siyah the, danton ki banawat khoobsurat thi, aankhon ki palkon ke baal ghane aur lambe the, dono kandhon ke darmiyan fasla zyada tha, peshani kushada thi, Aap apne dono qadmon se poori tarah zameen par qadam rakhte the, un mein gehrai na thi, Aap aage bhi yaksooi se mutawajjeh hote aur peeche bhi yaksooi se mutawajjeh hote, main ne Aap jaisa na Aap se pehle dekha aur na Aap ke baad dekha."
"1156","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Zaid bin Aslam ne humein khabar di, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujh se Hazrat Umar ne kaha: Jab main tujhe kisi shakhs ki taraf bhejhun to use na bata ke main ne tujhe us ki taraf kis kaam ke liye bheja hai, kyunke shaitan us waqt us ke liye jhoot taiyar karta hai."
"1157","Hamid bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Zaid se, Lais se, Mujahid se, unhon ne farmaya: Woh is baat ko naapasand karte the ke aadmi apne bhai ki taraf tez nigah se dekhe, ya jab woh us ke paas se uthe to apni nigah us ke peeche lagaye, ya us se pooche: Tum kahan se aaye ho aur kahan ja rahe ho."
